REMARK   5 1PCY THE NINE-STRANDED SHEET DESCRIBED BELOW IS ACTUALLY AN          
REMARK   5 1PCY EIGHT-STRANDED BETA BARREL. THIS IS DENOTED BY THE              
REMARK   5 FIRST 1PCY STRAND RECURRING AS THE LAST STRAND. STRAND 8 IS          
REMARK   5 ADJACENT 1PCY TO STRAND 9 (STRAND 1) BUT THERE ARE NO                
REMARK   5 INTERSTRAND 1PCY H-BONDS. THE STRANDS OF THE BETA-BARREL             
REMARK   5 NUMBERED 1, 2, 3, 1PCY 4, 5, 6, 7, 8 AND 9 CORRESPOND TO             
